                "entry_id": "55779bb2-2f67-3ac4-b5e0-97c14d388d44",
                "word": "caninoïde",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3fd0b99e-0bd6-4476-aee6-5a219a3e940b",
                        "entry_id": "55779bb2-2f67-3ac4-b5e0-97c14d388d44",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "caninoïdes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5256731f-f3cb-3077-980a-f8c7499f1106",
                        "entry_id": "55779bb2-2f67-3ac4-b5e0-97c14d388d44",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a la forme d’un canin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15469753-e265-4866-865f-c4728196408b",
                                "sense_id": "5256731f-f3cb-3077-980a-f8c7499f1106",
                                "text": "De même, si l’on considère, non le désignateur rigide d’essence « chien », mais le concept descriptif d’un chien, alors à nouveau, un chien qui est une boule de guimauve de forme caninoïde est concevable, parce que, par exemple, c’est l’apparence et le comportement d’un chien, plus que sa composition interne, qui, parmi le faisceau de notes intelligibles formant le sens étroit de notre concept de chien, auront été retenus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2430e86-a807-3226-af46-c4113394d886",
                        "entry_id": "55779bb2-2f67-3ac4-b5e0-97c14d388d44",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a la forme d’une canine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3a93e3b-564e-45cf-b397-86070917e756",
                                "sense_id": "e2430e86-a807-3226-af46-c4113394d886",
                                "text": "Ce sont les Sciaenidés munis de dents différenciées plus ou moins caninoïdes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "36718a31-c87c-483f-a42c-2f0a56a09efb",
                        "source_entry_id": "55779bb2-2f67-3ac4-b5e0-97c14d388d44",
                        "target_lang_word": "caninoid",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "caninoid",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75c39f82-56dd-3600-aacc-7ce867d8e8f8",
                                        "entry_id": "1a0fe2b9-80f4-34f7-8a58-891d0ed36715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the appearance or characteristics of a canine (canid)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66e54975-8cf0-4874-880b-2d5daf876589",
                                                "sense_id": "75c39f82-56dd-3600-aacc-7ce867d8e8f8",
                                                "text": "\"The vast underground garage is patrolled by another species of humanoid (caninoid?), these tooled to look like pet dogs but functioning as police vehicles.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "198000d0-5d85-3016-aa40-17b40afb321f",
                                        "entry_id": "1a0fe2b9-80f4-34f7-8a58-891d0ed36715",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the appearance or characteristics of a canine tooth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9d6f010-0275-47f0-b49e-5a08b641a33b",
                                                "sense_id": "198000d0-5d85-3016-aa40-17b40afb321f",
                                                "text": "Lower jaw with several rows at anterior, outer row enlarged, posterior teeth larger but not caninoid. Upper jaw with several rows at anterior, less rows than lower jaw, outer row larger but not caninoid. No canines present."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "caninoid",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88d30d36-6048-3da5-9520-e956ca9a0299",
                                        "entry_id": "ebbfe67f-3517-3f5a-963f-f3da38d57830",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A being having the appearance or characteristics of a canine (canid)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "444cd359-a971-4942-90ff-5216d736e14f",
                                                "sense_id": "88d30d36-6048-3da5-9520-e956ca9a0299",
                                                "text": "2018 Vyacheslav Kharchienko et al, eds, Dependable IoT for Human and Industry: Modeling, Architecting, Implementation, River Publishers, 2018, page 38.\n\"A local company (Boston Dynamics) has produced a family of robots who have become media stars: ...; SpotMini a \"caninoid\" can open doors, descend stairs backwards, and run autonomously in mixed human robot packs.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c23a6504-8d06-35c7-b306-611722d55e19",
                                        "entry_id": "ebbfe67f-3517-3f5a-963f-f3da38d57830",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tooth having the appearance or characteristics of a canine tooth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ce80f6a-5bec-41a3-876c-4a21d035c37a",
                                                "sense_id": "c23a6504-8d06-35c7-b306-611722d55e19",
                                                "text": "\"Probably the terminal, wide, oblique mouth, usually armed with enlarged teeth or caninoids or large canines of the Otalithinae, indicates the hunting of prey in superficial water,...\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
